  "description": "Demolition and replacement of rear extension with green roof and two lightweight metal framed conservatory style extensions with frosted glazed roof forms at rear lower ground floor level; replacement of windows and doors with double glazed units to include new timber garage door and new entrance door to Flat 1; and replacement of roof lights to the side passage roof at ground floor level ; associated internal alterations at ground floor level. Demolition of side conservatory and replacement with new lightweight timber framed structure of similar appearance, infill rear extension with timber framed French doors with Juliet balcony and introduction of new timber framed French door with Juliet balcony to guest room at rear elevation, two new sash timber framed windows to the side with frosted glazing; new leaden roof covering to replace existing over the existing side infill; replacement of 6 x timber framed sash double glazed windows to the front; Yorkstone tiles to front/side at raised ground floor level. Replacement of 3 x single glazed timber framed sash windows to front with double glazed units to front; two - timber framed sash windows to the rear; existing timber framed double doors to be replaced with timber framed double glazed doors; and associated alterations at first floor level. Replacement of 3 x timber framed sash windows to front; timber framed window to side, 3 x timber framed windows to rear and associated alterations of making good at second floor level.",
